---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Aedrian Ponce — Systems Engineer & Applied Mathematician"
  description="Background, academic focus at UPLB, systems engineering philosophy, and technical stack of Aedrian Ponce."
>
  <div class="atmospheric-wrapper min-h-screen bg-[#050607]">
    <div class="atmospheric-grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="atmospheric-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="atmospheric-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="relative z-10 w-full text-[#F5F5F7] pt-32 pb-24 px-6 md:px-12">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-16">
        
        <!-- Biography Intro -->
        <section class="space-y-6">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs text-[#8EBBC8] uppercase tracking-widest">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#8EBBC8] animate-pulse"></span>
            <span>Aedrian Ponce // Dian · UPLB Applied Math</span>
          </div>

          <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-display font-bold tracking-tight text-[#F5F5F7] leading-[0.95]">
            Applied Mathematics student, distributed systems engineer, AI agent builder.
          </h1>

          <p class="font-body text-lg md:text-xl text-[#C8CDD0] leading-relaxed font-light">
            I am a multidisciplinary student builder studying Applied Mathematics at the University of the Philippines Los Baños (UPLB). My engineering focus sits at the convergence of rigorous mathematical abstractions, low-latency web systems, and autonomous AI agent loop architectures.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Engineering Principles -->
        <section class="p-8 lg:p-10 bg-[#101214] border border-[#22262B] rounded-xl space-y-8 shadow-xl">
          <h2 class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-display font-bold text-[#F5F5F7]">
            Core Engineering Principles
          </h2>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 font-body text-sm text-[#8C9296] leading-relaxed">
            <div class="space-y-2.5">
              <h3 class="font-mono text-xs text-[#8EBBC8] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">01 / Mathematical Grounding</h3>
              <p>
                I treat software systems as discrete mathematical objects. Whether calculating route isochrones, evaluating directed graph traversals with $A^*$, or modeling memory layouts, mathematical rigor precedes code syntax.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-2.5">
              <h3 class="font-mono text-xs text-[#8EBBC8] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">02 / Non-Blocking Concurrency</h3>
              <p>
                Heavy computational workloads—such as computer vision tensor inference, matrix transformations, and streaming parsers—must never block the main thread. I rely on dedicated Web Workers, typed ArrayBuffers, and demand-based frame loops.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-2.5">
              <h3 class="font-mono text-xs text-[#8EBBC8] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">03 / Privacy by Construction</h3>
              <p>
                User privacy is an architectural invariant. Student academic records remain in local browser IndexedDB; camera landmark tensors stay on-device; and personal travel data never touches a centralized server.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-2.5">
              <h3 class="font-mono text-xs text-[#8EBBC8] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">04 / Anti-Vibecode Discipline</h3>
              <p>
                I eliminate generic AI boilerplate and template slop. Every layout, design token, 3D shader, and component is crafted with purpose, verified by unit tests, and audited across real mobile viewports.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Technical Stack Matrix -->
        <section class="space-y-8">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-display font-bold text-[#F5F5F7] tracking-tight">
            Technical Stack & Tooling
          </h2>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <div class="p-6 bg-[#101214] border border-[#22262B] rounded-xl space-y-3 shadow-sm">
              <h3 class="font-mono text-xs text-[#8EBBC8] uppercase font-bold tracking-wider">Languages & Runtimes</h3>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                {['TypeScript', 'JavaScript (ESNext)', 'Python 3', 'SQL (PLpgSQL)', 'HTML5 / CSS3'].map((item) => (
                  <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-[#181B1E] border border-[#22262B] text-xs font-mono text-[#F5F5F7] rounded">
                    {item}
                  </span>
                ))}
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="p-6 bg-[#101214] border border-[#22262B] rounded-xl space-y-3 shadow-sm">
              <h3 class="font-mono text-xs text-[#8EBBC8] uppercase font-bold tracking-wider">Frameworks & 3D Graphics</h3>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                {['Astro 5', 'Svelte / SvelteKit', 'React 19', 'Three.js / R3F', 'Tailwind CSS v4', 'GSAP'].map((item) => (
                  <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-[#181B1E] border border-[#22262B] text-xs font-mono text-[#F5F5F7] rounded">
                    {item}
                  </span>
                ))}
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="p-6 bg-[#101214] border border-[#22262B] rounded-xl space-y-3 shadow-sm">
              <h3 class="font-mono text-xs text-[#8EBBC8] uppercase font-bold tracking-wider">Systems, Data & Edge</h3>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                {['Supabase (PostgreSQL / RLS)', 'IndexedDB Local-First', 'Vercel Edge', 'Web Workers', 'MediaPipe AI', 'Electron'].map((item) => (
                  <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-[#181B1E] border border-[#22262B] text-xs font-mono text-[#F5F5F7] rounded">
                    {item}
                  </span>
                ))}
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="p-6 bg-[#101214] border border-[#22262B] rounded-xl space-y-3 shadow-sm">
              <h3 class="font-mono text-xs text-[#8EBBC8] uppercase font-bold tracking-wider">Testing, QA & Modeling</h3>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                {['Vitest', 'Playwright E2E', 'Blender 5.0 (Python API)', 'Git / GitHub', 'Model Context Protocol (MCP)'].map((item) => (
                  <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-[#181B1E] border border-[#22262B] text-xs font-mono text-[#F5F5F7] rounded">
                    {item}
                  </span>
                ))}
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Academic & Research Progression -->
        <section class="space-y-6">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-display font-bold text-[#F5F5F7] tracking-tight">
            Academic Grounding & Research Focus
          </h2>

          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="p-6 bg-[#101214] border border-[#22262B] rounded-xl space-y-2">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-xs text-[#8EBBC8]">
                <span>01 // UPLB APPLIED MATHEMATICS</span>
                <span class="text-[#666B6E]">FOUNDATIONS</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-display font-bold text-[#F5F5F7]">Discrete Systems, Graph Theory & Matrix Algebra</h3>
              <p class="font-body text-sm text-[#8C9296] leading-relaxed">
                Rigorous study of discrete structures, topological routing models, matrix transformations, and numerical methods at the University of the Philippines Los Baños.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-6 bg-[#101214] border border-[#22262B] rounded-xl space-y-2">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-xs text-[#8EBBC8]">
                <span>02 // SYSTEMS ARCHITECTURE</span>
                <span class="text-[#666B6E]">ENGINEERING</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-display font-bold text-[#F5F5F7]">Low-Latency Runtimes & Non-Blocking Concurrency</h3>
              <p class="font-body text-sm text-[#8C9296] leading-relaxed">
                Designing memory-safe, worker-isolated architectures that execute complex heuristics and computer vision inference without starving browser render frames.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-6 bg-[#101214] border border-[#22262B] rounded-xl space-y-2">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-xs text-[#8EBBC8]">
                <span>03 // AUTONOMOUS AGENT ORCHESTRATION</span>
                <span class="text-[#666B6E]">FRONTIER</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-display font-bold text-[#F5F5F7]">Model Context Protocol & Deterministic QA Loops</h3>
              <p class="font-body text-sm text-[#8C9296] leading-relaxed">
                Building multi-agent tool loops, custom MCP servers, and automated verification test harnesses that enforce zero-hallucination execution.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Verification Boundary Note -->
        <section class="p-6 bg-[#101214] border border-[#22262B] rounded-xl space-y-3 font-mono text-xs text-[#8C9296]">
          <div class="text-[#F5F5F7] font-bold">PUBLIC EVIDENCE INTEGRITY NOTE</div>
          <p class="leading-relaxed">
            This portfolio is maintained under strict clean-room evidence gating. All project claims, code repositories, and technical roles are tied directly to public verifiable repositories (`github.com/Diannn3`). Unconfirmed roles or outcomes retain explicit confirmation gates.
          </p>
        </section>

        <!-- Call to Action -->
        <div class="pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-4 font-mono text-xs">
          <a
            href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/aedrian-ponce-a602b0398/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer noopener"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-3.5 bg-[#8EBBC8] text-[#050607] font-bold text-center hover:bg-[#A5D0DC] transition-colors rounded shadow-md"
          >
            Let’s build a system together ↗
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://github.com/Diannn3"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer noopener"
            class="w-full sm:w-auto px-6 py-3.5 border border-[#22262B] bg-[#101214] text-[#C8CDD0] hover:text-[#FFFFFF] hover:border-[#8EBBC8] transition-colors rounded text-center"
          >
            Explore GitHub Profile ↗
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
